# The Gradle wrapper is committed on purpose (gradlew, gradlew.bat,
# gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar): flutter_tools can inject one from the local
# SDK cache, but committing it keeps the Gradle version byte-identical on every
# machine and in CI.  Do not re-add the usual gradle-wrapper.jar / gradlew
# ignore rules from the `flutter create` template.

